# Records the README demo on made-up data: make screenshots

Output docs/images/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1400
Set Height 760
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 120ms

Hide
Type "make -s demo-tui"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Show

Sleep 2.5s
Screenshot docs/images/today.png
Sleep 1s

Type "2"
Sleep 2s
Screenshot docs/images/shelf.png
Sleep 1s
Type "j"
Sleep 600ms
Type "j"
Sleep 1s

Type "3"
Sleep 3s
Screenshot docs/images/stats.png
Sleep 1s

Type "4"
Sleep 2s

Type "1"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "s"
Sleep 2s
Screenshot docs/images/settings.png
Sleep 1s
Down 6
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Escape
Sleep 1.5s
